msgid ""
"WARNING: THE PMIC FUEL GAUGE WILL BE RESET AND THE SYSTEM WILL POWER OFF!\n"
"\n"
"LEAVE THE CHARGER UNPLUGGED AND POWER THE DEVICE BACK ON AFTER A FEW SECONDS. THE BATTERY LEVEL IS RE-ESTIMATED FROM THE RESTING BATTERY VOLTAGE AND BECOMES ACCURATE AGAIN AFTER A FULL CHARGE.\n"
